  "description": "The proposed works include the removal of existing front and rear lean-to structures, repair and repointing of external masonry, and installation of new foundations with infill panels incorporating roller shutters and pedestrian doors. External upgrades also include palisade fencing and lighting to both yard areas. Internally, the project involves demolition of office, kitchen, and WC areas (approx. 35m²), construction of a new accessible WC pod with extended drainage, installation of an arch lining system, and floor repairs including concrete patching, latex levelling, and epoxy coating (approx. 40m²). Electrical works include removal of tenant installations, retention of the existing three-phase supply, new LED lighting and exit signage, and relocation of the electrical meter and distribution board. Additional works include water supply upgrades, drainage repairs, and full internal and external redecoration.",
